.container
  {{view App.HeaderView noMenu=true}}

  .guide-content
    .iright
      .screenshot-container
        .intro-collaboration

    .ileft
      .info-container
        %h2 Code Together

        %p
          Sometimes you need motivation to make progress on an app. Or a little education on a new language or framework. Pair programming is great, but it's tough when you're not in the same room.

        %p
          With Nitrous.IO, you can invite any number of collaborators to join your box so you can code collaboratively all in the browser.

        .hlinks
          %h4 Helpful Links
          %ul
            %li
              %a.link(href="http://help.nitrous.io/collab" target="_blank") Getting Started with Collaboration

  .panel
    %button.btn.btn-primary.pull-right(_action='didClickNextScreen target="view"')
      Next

    %button.btn(_action='didClickPrevScreen target="view"')
      Previous
